_Anzai et al.-2021-Finding Retro Places in Jap.txt,Finding “Retro” Places in Japan: Crowd-sourced Urban Ambience Estimation,Shu ANZAI; et al.,,2021,conference paper,"Local Rec’21, November 2–5, 2021, Beijing, China",,,,,,,,,,,,,Nara; Kyoto; Gango-ji Temple; Kyoto Imperial Palace; Nijo Castle,Japan; Beijing; London,,,"Despite this fact, previous studies have focused primarily on the physical components of the ambience, hence overlooking the subjective components.","In this study, we aim to ﬁll this gap by (1) crowdsourcing labels to quantify the ambience of a city based on people’s impressions of street and landscape images, and (2) investigating a method to estimate the aﬀective ambience from such landscape images.",Flickr; Google Maps,images; landscape images,GPS coordinates,heat maps,,,,"2,220 images","1,133 responses",,"2,220",,,,,Nara and Kyoto,Google Street View Static API,Google Street View Static API,,"applied znormalization to calculate the average score of each street, yielding the ambience score","excluding inappropriate responses (e.g., the same answer is given for all questions) from crowdsourcing",crowdsourcing,crowd workers from Yahoo! JAPAN crowdsourcing,['four-point scale'],,regression,Convolutional Neural Networks (CNN),Goog Le Net,pre-trained convolutional neural network (CNN) model,,,landscape images,,70:30,,,,,,,,{},,,,,,,22-layer CNN,"To build the model, we combined two machine learning models, a pre-trained convolutional neural network (CNN) model, and a linear regression model.",no,[],,,,,,,,,,correlation; mean absolute error (MAE); Pearson’s correlation coeﬃcient,[],[],[],,,[],[],,[],[],[],70:30 (training data: test data) ratio,,[],heatmaps,[],[],[],[],[],[],['route recommendation'],[],[],[],[],"['the models are not suﬃciently versatile to work with images from other cities.', 'it is diﬃcult for a model trained on the landscape images of one city to properly estimate the ambience of the landscape of another city.']",[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],,,