_Bounab et al.-2020-Reconciling Image Captioning and.txt,Reconciling Image Captioning and User s,Yazid Bounab; Abdelkrim Meziane; Mohamed Reda Bounab; Fouad Bounab; Abdelhamid Mellouk,,2020,other,,IEEE,,https : //www.kaggle.com/yazidbounab/tourism48 − for −image −captioning −and −nlp −process,,,,urban,,,,,,,48 countries (2),,,This paper presents a novel approach to perform such reconciliation in a way to beneﬁt tourism industry.,This paper aims to tackle this aspect of analysis in tourism case study.,IMGUR (3); Trip advisor,images (10); textual content (5); videos (2); comments (11); replies (4),,,,,,,,,480 (2),,,,,48 different countries,API availability,IMGUR api (2),"For each country, we selected 10 galleries.",Remove URLs; ii) Remove emails; iii) Remove emojis; iv) Remove punctuation; v) Lowercase all characters; vi) Remove stopwords; vii) Remove swear expressions; ix) Remove extra-spaces; x) True case Annotation.,,Google Cloud Vision API,,[],,image captioning (10); string matching (2); named entity recognition (NER),Convolutional Neural Networks (CNNs) (3); Recurrent Neural Networks (RNNs) (2),,,,,raw images; users comments; replies,,,,,,,,,,{},,,,,,,,"First, we download the image and the corresponding comments/replies. Second, for each image of the gallery, we take the whole comments as one single textual document, Then, we apply the following preprocessing stage. This consists of i) Remove URLs; ii) Remove emails; iii) Remove emojis; iv) Remove punctuation; v) Lowercase all characters; vi) Remove stopwords; vii) Remove swear expressions; ix) Remove extra-spaces; x) True case Annotation.",no,[],,,,,,,,,,,[],[],[],,,[],[],,[],[],[],,,[],,[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],,Tourism48 dataset has been made available for research community.,,,,,,,,,
