ists, which can enhance their entertainment and tourism experience.'}; {'value': 'Political – Educational', 'reasoning': 'The project aims to develop solutions for local growth and contribute to the sustainable and inclusive development of the territory, which aligns with the educational role of heritage assets for political purposes.'}; {'value': 'Aesthetical – Artistic', 'reasoning': 'The paper discusses the design of Cultural Objects and Cultural Places, which involves considering architectural forms, points of interest, and landmarks that have shaped the territory plastically.'}",,Lazio region (4); Rome (1); Collegio Romano (2); Sabina (1),Lazio region (4); France (2); UK (2); Wales (1); Italy (1),,,"tant (Her Me S) project, funded by Regione Lazio and aimed at oﬀering tools and innovative services to favour the fruition of (tangible and not tangible) Cultural Heritage in the Lazio region through advanced AI and ICT methodologies and technologies.","The Her Me S project aims to build a new application for smartphones with diﬀerent target users, i.e. tourists, citizens, economic operators, and public administrations.",Facebook (1); Twitter (1); Google Play Store (1); Apple’s App Store (1),multimedia (3); text (1); audio (1); pictures (1); movies (1),geolocation (2),,,reviews (2); evaluations (2); stories (1),,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,[],,recommendation (3); personalisation (1); planning (2); scheduling (1); classifying (2),machine learning (2); artiﬁcial intelligence (AI) (10),,,,,,,,,,,,,,,{},,,,,,,,,no,[],,,,,,,,,,,[],[],[],,,[],[],,[],[],[],,,[],,[],[],[],[],[],[],"['cultural tourism promotion (1)', 'cultural heritage promotion (1)', 'cultural heritage preservation (1)']",[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],,,,,,Flutter (1); Node.js (1); SQL (1),,Smart Specialisation Strategy (1); Smart Specialization Platform (S3 Platform) (1); Horizon 2020 (1); Europe 2020 Strategy (1); Open Source (3); Web 2.0 (1); User Centre Design (1); User eXperience (1); GANTT Chart (2); Fig