_Bui et al.-2025-Topic Modelling and Sentiment An.txt,Topic Modelling and Sentiment Analysis,,,,,,,,,,,,,historical sites (2); historical landmark,historical signiﬁcance (2); heritage tourism (2); heritage sites (3); preservation efforts; cultural heritage (2); historical importance; educational value; cultural beneﬁts; heritage site analysis; cultural signiﬁcance; historical elements,,"{'value': 'Historic-Artistic', 'reasoning': 'The paper discusses the architectural appreciation of The Independence Palace, highlighting its aesthetic appeal and design from the 1960s-70s, which aligns with the value of being a rare or unique example of historical, stylistic, or artistic movements.'}; {'value': 'Educational', 'reasoning': ""The paper emphasizes the historical significance of heritage sites like The Independence Palace, which provide insights into a nation's history and culture. This aligns with the educational role of heritage assets in providing knowledge about the past.""}; {'value': 'Emotional (collective)', 'reasoning': 'The paper mentions that heritage sites are crucial for preserving national identity and offering a tangible link to the past, which contributes to a sense of continuity. This aligns with the emotional value of cultural identity and a sense of place attachment.'}",maintenance (2); preservation efforts; heritage tourism management; preventative maintenance plans,Ho Chi Minh City; Vietnam; The Independence Palace (12); Cu Chi Tunnels; War Remnants Museum; Angkor Wat,Vietnam (4); South Africa; WI,1960s-70s,,"What speciﬁc aspects of The Independence Palace experience generate negative sentiment among reviewers, and how can these issues be addressed?",How can topic modeling be used to identify aspects of the palace that are most salient to visitors and shape their overall impressions?,Trip Advisor (11); Tik Tok; Facebook; Instagram; Google Play Store,user-generated content (UGC) (7); online reviews (6); social media posts; travel blogs; electronic word-of-mouth (e-WOM),,,,,reviewer name; rating; sentiment rating; short and full review text; reviewer country; total contributions; type of traveler; review date,"5,023",,,,,,,between the year 2011 to 2023,The Independence Palace,comprehensive data collection of all available reviews for The Independence Palace on Trip Advisor,Python and the Selenium library,,reﬁned by removing incomplete entries,Reviews were classiﬁed as either positive (rating 5) or negative (ratings 1 to 4).,,,[],,sentiment analysis (6); topic modeling (6); classiﬁcation (4); predictive modeling; text mining; clustering,machine learning (ML) (5); Natural Language Processing (NLP) (3); Multinomial Naive Bayes (NB); Logistic Regression; Random Forest (RF); K-Nearest Neighbors (KNN); Latent Dirichlet Allocation (LDA) (4); Non-Negative Matrix Factorization (NMF); Latent Semantic Analysis (LSA),,,,,,,,,,,,,,,{},,,,,,,,"The dataset was then processed using machine learning techniques, specifying reviews as positive or negative, while topic modeling, particularly LDA, was used to identify recurring themes within the reviews.",no,[],,,,,,,,,,accuracy (5); precision; recall; F1-score (5); ROC-AUC (4),[],[],[],,,[],[],,[],[],[],,,[],word cloud,[],[],[],[],[],[],[],"['Heritage managers should implement preventative maintenance plans to preserve the site’s appeal.', 'improvements in guided tours and information access, as highlighted in the topic modeling, would enhance the visitor experience, contributing to higher satisfaction.']","['This study demonstrates the effectiveness of machine learning techniques, such as sentiment analysis and LDA, in analyzing UGC within heritage tourism.', 'providing a replicable framework for future studies at other heritage sites and enhancing understanding of how historical and architectural elements shape tourism experiences.']",[],[],"['This study is limited by its reliance on Trip Advisor reviews, excluding non-English feedback.', 'future studies should explore other historical sites to generalize these ﬁndings and provide a deeper understanding of heritage tourism across Vietnam.']",[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],,,,,,Selenium,,visitor experience (5); tourism promotion; destination marketing; tourism satisfaction; war museums; historic buildings; war remnants; military operations; combatants; civilians; travel review site; destination imagery; visitor sentiments; visitor feedback; cultural landmarks; visitor perceptions; traveler preferences; emerging trends; destination reputation; overall visitor satisfaction; sentiment groups; key areas; emotional reactions; strategic actions; customer perceptions; electronic word-of-mouth (e-WOM); face-to-face WOM; critical themes; tourism experiences,,,
