_Burkov and Gorgadze-2023-From text to insights understan.txt,From text to insights: understanding,Ivan Burkov; Aleksei Gorgadze,"HSE University, SaintPetersburg, Russia; University of Tartu, Tartu, Estonia",2023,journal article,International Tourism Studies Association,Emerald Publishing Limited,,www.emeraldgrouppublishing.com/licensing/reprints.htm,,,,,museums,,,Emotional (collective); Entertainment; Educational; Symbolic,,St. Petersburg museums,Russia,,COVID-19 pandemic,"Despite the importance and relevance of the topic, there is little research on the factors influencing museum visitors’ satisfaction based on UGC.",This research’s goal is to determine consumer experience dimensions that lead to higher satisfaction and intention to share positive emotions through the study of Trip Advisor users’ reviews on St. Petersburg museums.,Trip Advisor,text,,,,ratings,number of contributions; helpful votes,"23,020",,,,,,,April 2011 to May 2021,St. Petersburg,utilizing Data Miner software,Data Miner software,"the sample has been reduced to not more than 1,500 reviews per museum","All words were lemmatized – transformed into infinitive form – applying the My Stem tool by the Yandex company (Segalovich, 2003). Lemmatization is more suitable rather than stemming for the Russian language, due to the high diversity of language lemmas. Afterward, stop words – lemmas with no semantic meaning – were excluded from the sample using the “stopwords” package",,,,[],,classification,Regression models,logit regression (LR),,,,lemmas (words),,"10% of the sample was selected randomly for testing, the remaining 90% were used for training",,,,,,,,{},Naive Bayes; decision trees,,,,,,,,no,[],,,,,,,,,,Accuracy,['0.824 Accuracy'],[],[],p-value of 9.191e-09,,[],[],,[],[],[],Ten-fold cross-validation is used for training,Naı¨ve Bayes; decision trees,[],word clouds,[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],"['This research applied methods for data collection and analysis with precise results, which have not been used 