nuanced values arising therein, which inform sustainable environmental planning and management.'}",landscape planning (3); ecosystem management; heritage listing; heritage protection; conservation,Collserola; Barcelona; Spain; Tibidabo Monastery,Barcelona; Spain; Catalan Coastal Mountain Range; Mediterranean Sea; rivers Llobregat and Bes`os; plains of Barcelona and Vall`es; Europe,,,"Yet, methodological hurdles in deploying consistent qualitative and quantitative assessments of multiple sociocultural values challenge their integration in a planning praxis, one that is attentive to the underlying drivers of social-ecological co-production.","(i) capturing the multiple relational CES values resulting from social-ecological interactions as revealed on SM data, including co-benefits and trade-offs; (ii) establishing and highlighting the advantages of using a consistent and replicable method and protocol for manually assessing multiple relational CES values through combined SM pictures and texts.",Social Media (SM) (10); Flickr (7),pictures (10); tags (5); texts (10); visual content (5); photo (4); multimedia data,geotagged (3),,,emotionally reacting,user identification; geotag; photo url; titles; descriptions,5170,471,,1692,,,,between 2004 and 2017,within the boundaries of Collserola,retrieved through the Flickr Application Programming Interface (API),Flickr Application Programming Interface (API),limited the number of similar units of data of the same owner to five per location,"photo and text content examination was manually conducted to filter out all those not focusing on social-ecological interactions, e.g. selfies, close-ups on buildings or infrastructures with no heritage value, indoor pictures and/or text with no mention to ecosystem appreciation.","If one or both of the textual and visual contents of the analysed units of data did not depict or refer to natural environments, the entire unit of data was excluded from the analysis.",manual coding,three different 