_Furini et al.-2022-A Predictive Method to Improve t.txt,A Predictive Method to Improve the Effectiveness,M. Furini; F. Mandreoli; R. Martoglia; M. Montangero,"Dipartimento di Comunicazione ed Economia, Viale Allegri 9, I-42121 Reggio Emilia, Italy; Dip. Scienze Fisiche, Informatiche e Matematiche, University of Modena and Reggio Emilia, Italy",2022,journal article,"ACM Journal on Computing and Cultural Heritage, Vol. 15, No. 2, Article 21",Association for Computing Machinery,https://doi.org/10.1145/3470786,https://business.twitter.com/it/analytics/tweet-activity-dashboard.html,,21:2 – 21:18,,,,,,,,,Italy; New York; United States; Europe,,Museum Week event organized by Twitter,These unanswered research questions motivate us to broaden the theoretical framework proposed in current studies by defining a method for implementing a museum-tailored social media communication strategy.,"In particular, we focus on the Twitter platform and we propose a method that properly combines a tweet classifier and a suggestion mechanism into a strategy to make on-the-fly tweet success prediction.",Facebook; Instagram; Twitter,images; text,,,,followers; retweets,,"around 40,000 tweets",23 world famous museums,,,,,,Late Spring 2020,,,,,,,,,[],,classification,Decision Tree; Random Forest,K-nearest neighbor; Ada Boost; XGBoost,,,Named Entity Recognition,number of hashtags; number of media contents; words; hashtags; mentions,,9:10 and 1:10,,,,,,,,{},,,,,,,,"The main aim of the approach is to study how content choices impact on popularity prediction and, thus, to offer easy-to-follow content suggestions to the media manager composing tweets so to make them more successful.",no,[],,,,,,,,,,accuracy; F-measure,[],[],[],,,[],[],,[],[],[],stratified randomized folds cross-validation technique,,[],,[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],"['machine learning method that can be used to predict the success of art museum tweets', 'suggestion mechanism that might be used to enhance tweet drafts in order to increase 