_Garzia et al.-2023-Understanding Twitter Emojis for.txt,Understanding Twitter Emojis for Sentiment,F. Garzia; R. Cusani,,2023,conference paper,IEEE International Carnahan Conference on Security Technology (ICCST),IEEE,10.1109/ICCST59048.2023.10474251,,,,cultural sites (1),,Royal Palace of Naples (4); historic centre (1); historic site (1),UNESCO (1); World Heritage site (1); cultural heritage (1),,"Emotional (collective) – Cultural identity, motivation and pride, sense of “place attachment,” and communal value. The study analyzes emotional responses from visitors to the Royal Palace of Naples, indicating a sense of place attachment and cultural identity associated with the site.; Entertainment – The role the asset plays in the contemporary market, especially tourism. The paper discusses the experiences of tourists visiting the Royal Palace of Naples, suggesting the site plays a role in the tourism market.; Symbolic – Emblematic expressions of power, authority, or prosperity deriving from the asset. The Royal Palace of Naples, serving as a residence for monarchs, symbolizes power and authority, reflecting its historical significance.",,Royal Palace of Naples,Italy (3); Naples (5); Campania (1),1600s (1),"event related to commemorating victims of organized crime, including the projection of victims' names on the façade of RPN (1)",assessing the perceived risk among visitors to heritage and cultural sites holds significant importance.,"We demonstrate how this estimation can elicit emotional responses from visitors through the application of sentiment analysis on Twitter data, including the analysis of emojis.",Twitter (7),text (2); emojis (8),,,Timeline Analysis (1),,,"up to 2,000 tweets (1)",,,,,,,7-8 days (1),,,Twitter API (1),,,,survey (3),"41 participants, equally distributed between male and female individuals aged 17 to 70 (1)","['positive', 'negative', 'Non-categorized Words']",,sentiment analysis (4); opinion mining (3); classification (2),machine learning (1)