_Iqbal et al.-2024-Behavior Analysis of Photo-Takin.txt,Behavior Analysis of Photo-Taking Tourists at Attraction-Level Tourist Destinations,MUHAMMAD IQBAL; LI RENJIE; JINGYI XU,"Hebei Normal University, China",2024,other,,,,,,,World Heritage (2),,Old Town of Lijiang (6); ancient town (1),UNESCO (1); World Heritage List (2); cultural elements (1); high-quality architecture (1); cultural heritage (1),,,heritage management (1),"Old Town of Lijiang; Mount Huashan; Akko Old City; Giant Panda National Park, China; Lion Grove; Beijing; Yuanmingyuan Park; Huangshan","Yunnan Province, China; Lijiang County; Japan; Germany; Nordic countries; China; Hong Kong; Peru; US cities",Song and Ming dynasties (1),inclusion in the World Heritage List (1),"However, the popularity of social media skyrocketing gener- ated a research gap on visiting and travelling patterns using geotagged images acquired from social media platforms [2], [3].",This paper investigates the landscape perception-based types of tourists by utilizing technology for location-based photo visual semantic mining at the attraction-level.,Flickr (7); Weibo (2); Tik Tok (1); Instagram (1); Facebook (1); Twitter (1); Go.com (1),images (10); photos (14); text (2); photographs (2); geotagged images (2); multimedia (1); metadata (5),geotagged (4); GPS (3); location information (3); geographical data (2),spatial distribution (4); spatial analysis (3); spatial attributes (1); spatial flows (1); spatial concentration (1); spatial associations (1),seasonal (4); time (1); temporal (1); time-space diaries (2); time-space (1); monthly (1); hourly (1),,,1537 photos,53 tourists,,,,,,2004- 2014,Lijiang County,,Yahoo Flickr Creative Common 100 million Dataset or YFCC 100M dataset,"downloaded with the keyword ‘‘Lijiang’’, which was later precisely cropped in Arc GIS software using the administrative boundary of ‘‘Lijiang County’’","To describe the spatiotemporal behaviour of tourists, locals and tourists with multiple visits have been isolated.","systematically assume that the stay of a photographer for more than 10 days will be considered as a local or multiple-visit, visitor in whole Lijiang County. Moreover, three or fewer shots from the camera with the same location information will not be considered a tourist.",,,[],,classification (4); topic modelling (1); sentiment analysis (2); image recognition (4),convolutional neural network (4); deep learning (6),Deep Senti Bank (DSB) (8); Alex Net (1); LDA (Latent Dirichlet Allocation) (5); ILSVRC2012 (1),the model learned from Image Net is effectively transferred to a specialized dataset like Senti Bank [26],,,image data (1); textual information (1); pixel (1); nouns (3),,,,stochastic gradient descent (1),0.001 (1),256 samples (1),77 epochs (1),weight decay (2),image trans- lation (1); horizontal reflections (2),"{'momentum': '0.9 (1)', 'weight decay values': '0.0005 (1)'}",,64-bit operating system (1),,,16 GB RAM (1),,This network is composed of eight blocks where the first five are the con- volution blocks and the last three are fully connected blocks.,"In this work, we used stochastic gradient descent to minimize the regression objective with the following parameter values.",no,[],,,,,,,,,,,[],[],[],,,[],[],,[],[],[],,,[],,[],[],[],[],[],[],"['tourism management (2)', 'facility management (1)', 'regional tourism (1)', 'sustainable tourism products (1)', 'seasonal management (1)', 'emergency warnings of scenic spots (1)', 'formulation of tourist tour routes during peak hours (1)']",[],"['We utilize the deep learning technique DSB to calcu- late the top 5 ANPs demonstrating the top five visual feature contents with the highest confidence.', 'We categorize the photos from the noun content into distinct groups using LDA.', 'We employ KDE as a spatial analysis tool to deter- mine the spatial distribution characteristics of tourists’ behaviors.', 'We classify the tourists based on the captured theme.', 'We provide extensive analysis of photo-taking tourists to understand their spatiotemporal behavior at the attraction-level.', 'We analyze the photo-taking behavioral patterns of different tourist types from individual preferences and depict them in terms of both visual semantics and spa- tiotemporal behavioral features.']",[],[],"['the generalizability of these results to different photo datasets remains untested.', 'Factors such as intrinsic motivation and the representation of tourist destinations significantly influence tourist behavior.', 'The current study primarily focused on analyzing external manifestations observed in tourist photo behavior, which offers a limited scope of understanding.', 'The dataset we used lacked comprehensive attribute information about tourists']",[],[],[],[],[],[],[],"['DSB was employed for analyze visual semantics of photos from Flickr data aiming at improved recognition accuracy. However, the generalizability of the proposed methodology using more data is still unexplored.', 'We acknowledge that tourists’ behavior is a subjective matter that has different meanings in various situations.', 'Intrinsic motivation of the tourists and inherent characteristics of the destinations have significant impact on the tourists’ behavior.', 'In this study, we have only focused on the appearances of different scenarios in photos to predict tourists’ behavior that limits the scope of understanding.', 'Furthermore, demographic information was not available in the dataset that prohibited a comprehensive analysis of landscape perceptions among various tourists’ categories.', 'Similarly, the dataset does not provide personal experiences, cultural backgrounds, and social status that may influence landscape perceptions.']",,The information used for this research is drawn from a set of 100 million publicly available multimedia from the Yahoo Flickr database.,,,64-bit operating system (1),Arc GIS (2),,Adjective noun pairs; attraction level activities; deep learning; kernel density estimation; latent Dirichlet allocation; spatiotemporal behavior; visual semantics; thematic tourists; photo-taking tourists; landscape perception; ANPs; POI; AOI; UGC,,,
