_Kosmas et al.-2024-Development a deeper understandi.txt,Development a deeper understanding of visitors' sentiments towards,,,,other,,,,,,,Natural Heritage (1),natural (3); cultural (2),Natura 2000 protected areas (2); Akamas Peninsula Natura 2000 site (5); Akamas national park (1); natural landscapes (3); natural beauty (1),natural values (1); cultural values (1); ecological value (2); cultural and natural heritage region (1); biodiversity (2); environmental management plans (2); preservation of natural heritage (1); sustainable tourism (3); responsible tourism (1); sustainability of protected areas (2); environmental conservation (1); environmental preservation (1); cultural values (1),,"{'SOCIAL VALUES': 'Emotional (collective) – The study highlights the importance of understanding visitor perceptions of protected areas, suggesting a focus on cultural identity and a sense of place attachment related to the Akamas Peninsula.'}; {'ECONOMIC VALUES': 'Entertainment – The study focuses on visitor experiences and satisfaction, indicating the role of the Akamas Peninsula in the tourism market and recreational activities.'}; {'POLITICAL VALUES': 'Management – The study aims to inform policymaking and sustainable environmental management, suggesting the incorporation of the Akamas Peninsula into political strategies and policies related to tourism and conservation.'}; {'HISTORIC VALUES': 'Educational – The study aims to provide knowledge about the past by analyzing visitor experiences and perceptions of the Akamas Peninsula.'}; {'AESTHETICAL VALUES': 'Artistic – The study focuses on the natural beauty and landscape of the Akamas Peninsula, highlighting its artistic and aesthetic qualities.'}; {'SCIENTIFIC VALUES': 'Technological – The study uses natural language processing and topic modeling techniques to analyze visitor feedback, demonstrating the application of technology in understanding and managing heritage sites.'}; {'AGE VALUES': 'Existential – The study represents memory and the lives of past generations by analyzing visitor experiences and perceptions of the Akamas Peninsula.'}; {'ECOLOGICAL VALUES': 'Spiritual – The study emphasizes the harmony between the Akamas Peninsula and its natural environment, highlighting the importance of ecological balance.'}",protection (2); preservation (3); environmental management (2),Akamas Peninsula; Akamas region,Cyprus (7); Mediterranean (1); European Union (1),,Covid19 pandemic (1),"The core objective of this study is to unravel the complex interplay between online reviews and visitor experiences, culminating in a deeper comprehension of how these digital interactions meld perceptions and shape the trajectories of tourist satisfaction.",The proposed approach involves deploying natural language processing and topic modelling techniques to extract valuable insights from visitors' e-Wo M feedback.,Trip Advisor (7),text (1); online reviews (3); electronic word-of-mouth (eWOM) (2),,,,satisfaction rating (2); helpful votes (1),username (1); feedback date (1); visit date (1); country of origin (1); feedback title (1); name and category of the landscape (1),7.786,,7.786,,,,,2010 to 2022,Akamas region,specially designed scraper,Python programming language,,"all characters in the text are converted to lowercase. In the second stage, punctuation marks are removed, and in the third stage, the so-called ""stopwords"" are removed, which concern words that do not have a specific meaning and do not contribute to the analysis.",,,,[],,topic modelling (3); sentiment analysis (1); clustering (2); classification (1); regression (2),Topic Models; Decision Trees,XGBoost (6),,,,text (6),,,,,,,,,,{},,,,,,,,"The new text is then transformed into keywords. To find the absolute number of topics, semantic coherence was applied for 40 different model cases. After finding the appropriate number of topics that represents the sample, the percentage number (theta value) of the topic was placed for each review.",no,[],,,,,,,,,,mean absolute deviation (2); mean squared deviation (2); root mean squared deviation (2),[],[],[],,,[],[],,[],[],[],,,[],,[],[],[],[],[],[],[],"['By integrating insights gained from visitor perspectives, the preservation of biodiversity can be better safeguarded.', 'This strategy aims to promote the enduring sustainability of protected areas, ensuring that preservation endeavours remain impactful and relevant over the long term.']",[],[],[],['Data quality and possible fake news issues may have adversely affected the results of this research.'],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],,,,,Python programming language,,,e-tourism (3); electronic tourism (1); electronic word-of-mouth (eWOM) (3); virtual social environment (2); socio- political support (1); visitor overcrowding (1); adequate information (1),,,
