_Kulkarni et al.-2020-Integrated Crowdsourcing Framewo.txt,Integrated Crowdsourcing Framework Using Deep Learning for Digitalization of Indian Heritage,U. Kulkarni; S. M. Meena; S. V. Gurlahosur; U. Mudengudi,,2020,conference paper,2019 IEEE Fifth International Conference on Multimedia Big Data (Big MM),IEEE,10.1109/BigMM50055.2020.00036,https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S187705 0918307944,,,Indian Heritage (6); Cultural Heritage (3),,architectural heritage (1); Indian landmarks (1); Indian monuments (1); heritage sites (10); heritage place (1); heritage site image (1),cultural data collection (1); preservation (2); ancestral wisdom (1); cultural heritage site (1); digital space (1); cultural infrastructure (1); rich heritage (1); chronicled legacy (1); immense realms (1); extraordinary domains (1); landmarks (1); culture (1); civilization (2); visual and execution craftsmanship (1); art structures (1); Indian landmarks (1); cultural inheritance (1); emerging technology (1); recording (1); filing (1); sharing (1); cultural digital asset (1); heritage places (1); digital preservation (1); landmark sites (1),,"{'SOCIAL VALUES': ""Emotional (collective) – The paper discusses the importance of preserving and sharing India's legacy to maintain cultural inheritance and pride among the masses.""}; {'HISTORIC VALUES': ""Educational – The paper aims to record, file, and share India's legacy to make it computerized as a piece of cultural digital asset, so that people on their visit to the heritage places will have the option to view information about the heritage place.""}; {'AESTHETICAL VALUES': 'Artistic – The paper mentions that India has produced an immense fortune of composed, visual and execution craftsmanship and art structures that address magnificence of the civic establishments.'}",preservation (2); digital preservation (1),,India (4); Indian (10); Singapore (1),,,The necessity for digitizing and storing the information of the heritage of our country is challenging due to sheer scale of cultural data collection and the reliability of sources.,"In this paper, we propose our work on building a fully-fledged web framework using emerging technologies to aid the preservation of cultural heritage site and its related data and to build a Deep Neural Network (DNN) which classifies Heritage sites with the crowdsourced data.",,images (12),,,,,,165518 images,,,165518,,,,,107 distinct heritage site,crowdsource image,,,,,labelled class,"students, faculty and their academic hierarchies",[],,classification (2); transfer learning (8); incremental learning (2),Deep Neural Network (DNN) (2),Mobile Net (6),pre-trained model (2),,,image (10),,80:20,,,0.0013979237,,6000,,,{},,,,,,,Mobile Nets are based on an optimized and computationally less intensive architecture that uses depth wise separable convolutions to build deep neural networks that consume less memory in deployment.,"Crowd-sourcing operation are initiated first then the data pre-processing of the crowd-sourced data happens which includes the following steps, collecting data from the proposed storage hierarchy based on functionality as in Figure 8. Further the collected data passes through the automatic pre-processing pipeline where the data is cleaned from blur, similar and occluded images and finally resized to resolution of [192X192]. After scaling the data based on the input layer of the model it is then retrained with the new incoming dataset.",no,[],,,,,,,,,,Accuracy (2),['98.75% accuracy'],[],[],,,[],[],,[],[],[],"Dataset is split in the ratio of 80:20, where the validation dataset contains 20% and training dataset contains 80% of the total curated IHDS dataset.",,[],,[],[],[],[],[],[],"['virtual reality (1)', 'augmented reality (2)']","['Cultural preservation (1)', 'awareness creation (1)']",[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],,,,,,Tensor Flow (5); Django (6),,crowdsourcing (16); Deep Neural Network (2); Transfer Learning (7); Web Framework (3); IHDS (Indian Herit