ocial network', 'co-occurrence networks']",element label,co-occurrence relationship between two connected labels in a picture,,,network density; clustering coefficient; centrality,co-occurrence matrix of element labels contained within each landscape type,,Gephi-0.9.4,identify combination characteristics between element labels,precision rate; recall rate; m AP; F1-score,"['object detection model performs optimally at a confidence level of 0.5. It has a precision rate of 92.3%, a recall rate of 88.5%, and a m AP of 95.7%', 'image classification model has a precision rate of 97.5%, a recall rate of 97.6%, and an F1-score of 97.5%']",['all labels have a m AP greater than 70%'],[],,,[],[],,[],[],[],,,[],,"['fusion of Yangzhou Ancient Canal and classical garden elements creates a unique ‘Canal and Watercraft Remains’ landscape that is highly sought after by tourists', 'tourists especially enjoy taking boat rides at night to experience the modern and classical culture along the Grand Canal', 'elements with high centrality represent the typical images of each landscape type and reflect tourists’ preferences for different landscape types']",[],"['heritage sites are relatively neglected by tourists, which reflects the differences in tourists’ perceptions of and interest in the value of different heritage sites']",[],[],['spatial structure of landscape preferences is characterized by a dense northern part and a sparse southern part'],['planning and design along the canal'],"['enhance the excavation of the cultural value of the landscape of the heritage sites', 'improve the level of natural landscape construction', 'emphasize the importance of the heritage of the settlements along the canal']",['deep learning-based method was designed to measure Chinese Grand Canal landscape preference'],['measurement method can efficiently extract the preference characteristics of the Chinese Grand Canal landscapes in the region and analyze the preference composition in terms of elemental and