_Liu and Zhu-2021-Multimodal Wireless Situational.txt,Multimodal Wireless Situational Awareness-Based Tourism Service Scene,Yan Liu; Shuo Zhu,"Huihua College, Hebei Normal University, Shijiazhuang 050000, China; Tourism College, Hebei University of Economics and Business, Shijiazhuang, Hebei 050061, China",2021,journal article,Journal of Sensors,Hindawi Limited,https://doi.org/10.1155/2021/5503333,https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1155/2021/5503333,,9 pages,,,,,,,,,China (2); Hebei Province; Guatemala,,,"To address the characteristics of tourism data in social media, this thesis focuses on the following challenges: it is diﬃcult to eﬃciently obtain tourism visualization information (text and images) in social media; it is diﬃcult to eﬀectively utilize tourism multimodal heterogeneous information; it is diﬃcult to properly retrieve multimedia entity information of tourism attractions; and it is diﬃcult to reasonably construct tourism personalized recommendation models.","In this paper, an image search reordering method based on a hybrid feature graph model is proposed to realize the rapid acquisition of high-quality Internet images from the web using hybrid visual features and graph models, thus providing data security for the analysis of social media-based tourism images.",Flickr (2); Tripadvisor; You Tube,text; images; videos; numerical information,geotagged images (2),,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,manually labeled,,['relevance'],,image search reordering; image classiﬁcation,graph model,SIFT,,,scale-invariant feature transform (SIFT),visual features; color; texture; Bov W features; color moment features,hybrid feature graph model,,,,,,,,,{},Crowd Reranking,,,,,,,"In the oﬄine learning phase, all the images are learned based on visual feature fusion using latent semantic analysis after extracting visual features. In the online ranking stage, a query word is given, and the initial ranking result of the returned images is obtained after matching with the textual information of the images, and then, the similarity between the images based on the hybrid features is calculated under the framework of the reordering of the graph model to complete the construction of the graph model, and ﬁnally, the reordering result is given.",yes,[],each image represents a node in the graph,the images are connected with edges whose weights represent the similarity between images based on hybrid features,,,,"Given a query term, a graph is constructed using the images returned by the search",,,,Normalized Discounted Cumulated Gain (NDCG),[],[],[],,,[],[],,[],[],[],,Crowd Reranking,[],,[],[],[],[],[],[],['personalized travel recommendation'],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],,The data used to support the ﬁndings of this study are available from the corresponding author upon request.,,,,,,,,,
