_Liu et al.-2021-Using text mining to track chang.txt,Using text mining to track changes,Matthew Tingchi Liu; Yongdan Liu; Ziying Mo; Kai Lam Ng,University of Macau; University of Macau; Macau University of Science and Technology; Sands China,2021,journal article,Asia Pacific Journal of Marketing and Logistics,Emerald Publishing Limited,10.1108/APJML-08-2019-0477,,,pp. 373-395,,,Macau’s Historic Centre (2),Historic Centre of Macau (2); world cultural heritage (2); heritage (2),,,,Macau (20); Las Vegas Strip,Macau (14); Mainland China (10); Hong Kong (4); Taiwan (4); China (4); New Zealand,,Macau government opened bidding for casino concessions in 2002,"However, due to the nature of TGC, analysing such data involves several challenges. First, online reviews are primarily qualitative, which makes it hard to quantify the data and convert it into knowledge. Second, the amount of data is usually extremely large and unstructured, which makes the information difficult to track (Netzer et al., 2014).",The objective is to utilise a large amount of TGC data posted on travel websites to allow travel destination marketers to understand tourists’ perceptions of a destination image.,Trip Advisor (12); Ctrip (20),reviews (6); photos (2); videos (2); text (2),,,,ratings (2),,"51,191 reviews",300 million members,"51,191 reviews",,,,,2014–2018 (3),Macau (2),web-content mining tool (web crawlers),Python (2),,"part-of-speech (POS) tagging and filtering were used to clean the data. Each word in a sentence was allocated a POS tag, such as noun, adjective or adverb. Only nouns and adjectives were retained for each sentence. Second, stop words – those without any valuable information – were eliminated","videos, graphs, and pictures were filtered for this study",,two translation specialists,[],,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,{},,,,,,,,,,[],,,,,,,,,,,[],[],[],Pearson’s correlation analysis (1); chi-square tests (1),,[],[],,[],[],[],,,[],word cloud (2),[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[