_López-Chao et al.-2023-UNREAL MEMORIES THE COLLECTIVE.txt,UNREAL MEMORIES: LA IMAGEN COLECTIVA DE LA ARQUITECTURA EN REDES SOCIALES VISUALES,"López-Chao, V; Fernández-Álvarez, Á.J; Rodríguez-Grela, M.",,2023,journal article,SOBRE,,,,,31-42,cultural heritage (2),,architecture (21); city (7); urban spaces (2); built environment (3); María Pita Square (3); Torres Blancas building (2); architectural heritage (2); world heritage site,patrimonio cultural; UNESCO; world heritage site,,"{'SOCIAL VALUES': 'Emotional (collective) – The study explores the collective image of architecture on social media, indicating a focus on cultural identity and communal value related to architectural spaces.'}; {'AESTHETICAL VALUES': 'Artistic – The paper discusses the visual characteristics of architectural images and their impact on social media, suggesting an emphasis on the artistic qualities of architecture.'}; {'HISTORIC VALUES': 'Educational – The research aims to understand how architecture is perceived and communicated through social media, implying an interest in the educational role of heritage assets in conveying knowledge about the past.'}",heritage conservation institutions,Torres Blancas in Madrid; María Pita Square; A Coruña City Hall,Madrid; Spain; Granada,1969,,"Therefore, the main goal of this research is to deepen in the construction of the collective image.",- What is the representation of the city and architecture that users share? - How do the users build that collective image? - What is the role of the architecture in the dissemination of architectural content in these media?,Instagram (20); You Tube (5),images (20); photographs (12); text (2),geolocation indexed information,spatial distribution; heat map,,likes (5); comments (3); saves; shares; engagement,hashtags (3); keywords (2); user profile,,,,,,,,over a period of five years,the city,collected the visual information of a building generated by Instagram users,,,,,,,[],,generate images,,Dall-e AI; Craiyon AI,,,,