_Majid et al.-2013-A context-aware personalized tra.txt,A context-aware personalized travel recommendation system,Muhammad Arif Majid; Lei Zhang; Jian Yang; Zhengtao Yu,,2013,other,International Journal of Geographical Information Science,Taylor & Francis,,www.tandfonline.com/journals/tgis20,,,,,,,,,,,China,,,,"In this article, we put forward an approach to extract semantically meaningful tourist locations from geotagged social media such as photos for tourist travel recommendations.",Flickr,photos; metadata; geotagged photos,geotagged photos; latitude; longitude,spatial distribution,time-stamp information,,tags; title; description; Taken time; Upload time; Lat; Long,"736,383",,,,,,,1 January 2001 and 1 July 2011,six cities in China,"We use the public API of Flickr to collect metadata of 736,383 geotagged photos that were taken in six cities in China between 1 January 2001 and 1 July 2011.",public API of Flickr,,"We removed the metadata of (1) photos that were collected in the result of search based on text containing name of a city in their metadata, that is, tags, title, and description but their spatial context (latitude, longitude) did not match the geographical context of that city, and (2) photos with incorrect temporal context.",,,,[],,clustering; recommendation,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,{},popularity rank (PR); classic rank (CLR); collaborative ﬁltering rank (CFR),,,,,,,,yes,['weighted undirected graph'],users and locations,users’ visits and the number of visits to particular locations,m users and n locations,,,,,,,Precision (P); Beneﬁt ratio (BR); Mean average precision (MAP@n),[],[],[],paired t-test with p < 0.05,,[],[],,[],[],[],,popularity rank (PR); classic rank (CLR); collaborative ﬁltering rank (CFR),[],,[],[],[],[],[],[],['tourist travel recommendations'],[],['We have contributed a method that applies a collaborative ﬁltering approach to obtain tourist’s preferences from his or her publicly contributed photos and takes into account the current context of user f