_Ralli et al.-2020-Crowd Heritage Improving the qu.txt,Crowd Heritage: Improving the quality of Cultural,Maria Ralli,,2017,other,,,,https://www.europeana.eu/portal/en,,,Cultural Heritage (CH) (4),digital cultural,digital cultural content (4); cultural heritage assets (2); cultural records (5); cultural heritage collections,metadata enrichment (5); annotations (14); digital cultural content metadata quality (3); digital cultural heritage domain; cultural institutions (2); cultural content (3); cultural records; Europeana (11); digital CH resources; CH content; metadata schemata; thematic collections (2); online thesauri; vocabularies (3); digital cultural objects; cultural collections; Europeana collection; digital cultural collec- tions; cultural items; datasets; metadata; high quality images; good quality metadata,,"{'SOCIAL VALUES': 'Emotional (collective) – The platform aims to engage different user communities and raise awareness about cultural heritage assets, fostering a sense of cultural identity and communal value by enabling users to contribute to the enrichment of digital cultural content.'}; {'POLITICAL VALUES': 'Educational – The platform is used for education on art and heritage, engaging with schools and pupils, and cleaning/improving the metadata available on Europeana, thus serving an educational role.'}; {'ECONOMIC VALUES': 'Use – The platform enhances the usability of digital cultural content by improving metadata quality, which in turn increases the potential for added-value services and applications that reuse these resources in innovative ways.'}; {'HISTORIC VALUES': 'Educational – The platform facilitates the discovery of cultural heritage and provides access to digital CH resources, offering potential for future knowledge about the past.'}; {'AESTHETICAL VALUES': 'Artistic – The platform uses AI to recognize art styles in paintings, assisting users in evaluating and annotating artworks, thus contributing to the appreciation of artistic heritag