he metadata available on Europeana.",[],[],,[],[],[],,,[],,[],[],[],[],[],[],"['education', 'discovery of cultural heritage', 'professional expertise']",['curating and promoting the content available on Europeana'],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],,,,,,,,crowdsourcing (6); automatic enrichment (2); user validation (2); annotations model; digital content (2); web technologies; cross-domain; metadata quality improvement; Machine Learning (ML); crowd; semantic tagging; image tagging; geotagging; semantic annotation; color-tagging; controlled online vocabularies; thesauri; gamiﬁcation; karma points; campaign editor; Linked Data resource; IRI; content analysis software; web-service; Linked Data; art style,,,
