"_Rehm and Manca-2021-Three Institutions, Three Platfo.txt","Three Institutions, three Platforms, One Goal: Social Media for Holocaust Remembrance",Martin Rehm; Stefania Manca,University of Southern Denmark; Italian National Research Council,2021,conference paper,ESM,,10.34190/ESM.21.041,https://www.researchgate.net/publication/352553578,,,,,Holocaust museums (3),Holocaust remembrance (2); Holocaust memory (6); Holocaust distortion (3); Holocaust education (4),,,,Yad Vashem in Israel (3); the United States Holocaust Memorial Museum in Washington D.C. (3); the Auschwitz-Birkenau Memorial and Museum in Poland (4),Israel; Poland; Washington D.C.,1941–1945,COVID-19 pandemic,there is a clear lack of empirical research on social media potential for teaching and learning about the Holocaust,"The main objective is to contribute to the study of the potential and limitations of the use of social media for Holocaust museums, with particular regard to the content that is published.",Twitter; Facebook; Instagram,text,,,,,,3.659,,,,,,,July 6th until September 7th 2020,,"The data were collected, using the commercial service Fanpage Karma",Fanpage Karma,,,,,,[],,topic modeling,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,{},,,,,,,,,yes,"['3-Mode network structure', '2-mode projections']","i) social media platforms, ii) museums and iii) most frequently used words",relationships amongst social media platforms and museums,,,,,,gephi,"to focus on similarities and differences in content (e.g., most frequently used words) between social media platforms and museums",,[],[],[],,,[],[],,[],[],[],,,[],,[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],['provides a methodological suggestion on how to use a mixed-method approach to identify similarities and differences between Holocaust memorials and museums and their content foci on different social media platforms'],[],[],"['We only considered three Holocaust memorials and museums.', 'Our networks analyses focussed on the interrelations between the three museums.', 'Finally, this is a purely quan