_Ye-2024-Research on the Protection and D.txt,Applied Mathematics and Nonlinear Sciences,Ziming Ye,,2024,journal article,Applied Mathematics and Nonlinear Sciences,,,https://www.sciendo.com,,,Cultural Heritage (4),tangible,rural landscapes (7); ancient buildings; sites,cultural heritage (10); protection (12); preservation (2); digital heritage (2); cultural landscape (7),,"{'value': 'Social - Emotional (collective)', 'reasoning': 'The paper discusses the importance of protecting and disseminating rural landscape culture to allow people to understand and recognize the rich connotation of traditional culture, which aligns with the concept of cultural identity and communal value.'}; {'value': 'Political - Educational', 'reasoning': 'The paper mentions that digital heritage and protection can make more people understand and pass on the cultural heritage of rural landscapes, which aligns with the educational role of heritage assets.'}; {'value': 'Historic - Artistic', 'reasoning': 'The paper discusses the digital protection of ancient buildings and sites, which are rare or unique examples of historical, stylistic, or artistic movements.'}; {'value': 'Aesthetical - Artistic', 'reasoning': 'The paper mentions that digital images of rural landscape cultural heritage can be treated and processed to get a finer display effect and better emphasize the cultural connotation of the heritage, which aligns with the artistic value.'}; {'value': 'Age - Existential', 'reasoning': 'The paper discusses the protection of traditional culture, which represents memory and the lives of past generations.'}",heritage protection (10); conservation (2); preservation (2),Mount Lushan; Village A (7),"Southern Italy; Zhangzhou, Fujian",,,"Therefore, how to protect and disseminate rural landscape culture has become an important issue in today’s society","This paper combines satellite remote sensing technology and computer image processing through image radiation correction, image fusion, cropping an