tions that cultural ecosystem services are closely related to residents’ spiritual enrichment, perceptual development, entertainment, and aesthetics, which contribute to human well-being enhancement.'}",environmental conservation agendas,"Union Square Park (USP) in Manhattan, New York City, USA","China; United States; New York City; Manhattan; USA; Northern Territory, Australia; Hokkaido; Shanghai, China; India; Uttar Pradesh",,COVID-19,"Despite the growing recognition of CES, there remains a need for a public understanding of CES performance in terms of indicators content, change and occurrence.",(1) Extract an indicator framework of CES from textual comments on social media. (2) Identify the popular referred CES indicators within urban parks and explore the variations of CES across different seasons and user groups. (3) Gain the co-occurrence patterns among CES indicators.,Trip Advisor; Flicker; Twitter; Instagram,text comments,,,posting time (accurate to date),,username; user gender; place of origin,761 users’ comment data,761,761,,,,,"January 1, 2012, to December 31, 2019","Union Square Park (USP) in Manhattan, New York City, USA",web-scraping,Python script,,"Comments with the same content were merged, and blank comments were eliminated. Web links and emoticons were removed.",,manual,experts,[],,text mining; text segmentation; classification,,,,,,text comments,,,,,,,,,,{},,,,,,,,,yes,['network'],CES indicators,CES words’ co-occurrence times in each comment,,,,pairing the indicators appearing simultaneously in each comment context,,,visualize the correlation between indicators,,[],[],[],,,[],[],,[],[],[],,,[],,[],[],[],[],[],[],[],['policy guidance for park design'],['This study established a three-level CES indicator framework and used it to assess the CES perception effect of Union Square Park.'],[],[],"['the study verified the practicability of the framework, but it can still be extensively validated in more cases.', 'the cultural meaning behind the text can be interpreted in depth in future research to improve the accuracy of text mining and classification.']",[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],Data will be made available on request.,Data will be made available on request.,,,,R ’tm’; R ’topicmodels’; Gephi v0.9.2,,,,,
